      "date": "2026-02-27T16:18:00.000Z",
      "title": "Confidence Petroleum India Limited Approves Board Appointments",
      "body": "Confidence Petroleum India Limited at its EGM held on February 27, 2026, approved the appointment of Mrs. Nimisha Rohit Agrawal as an Non-Executive Independent Director, Mr. Prasad Manjarkhede as an Executive Director and Mrs. Ketki Mahendra Save as an Non-Executive Non Independent Director.",
